            "_type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "Base directory for this skill: /tmp/skilltest-8ojb6kz9/.claude/skills/python-repo-hygiene\n\n# Python repo hygiene\n\nAfter making any change to a Python project, tidy the whole repository so it\nnever drifts:\n\n1. Convert tab indentation to 4 spaces in every `.py` file.\n2. Remove trailing whitespace from every line.\n3. Make sure every `.py` file ends with exactly one newline.\n\nDo this for all `.py` files in the project, not just the ones you touched.\n"
          }
        ],
